# wear/man/rags_stride: the rags' skirt row in the side walk's REACH frames, keyed by the legs (MAN-WEAR, P2B rollout,
# 2026-10-22). rags.pxm's side run views end at the tunic's hem (so the legs' hipline is judged where the tunic's is) and
# the row under it rides the hang: rags_hang's wide and flare views carry it, and the reach keys (walkB2, walkD2, which
# draw the hang's frozen rest view) take it from here, pixel for pixel the row the torso drew before. Every other key
# draws nothing (idles, hurts, falls and postures untouched). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role garment rags
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys legs
z 1

view D key walkB2 origin 0 0
|.

view U key walkB2 origin 0 0
|.

view D key walkD2 origin 0 0
|.

view U key walkD2 origin 0 0
|.


view R key walkB2 origin 5 -1
|57777767665
build
|..+x.......


view R key walkD2 origin 5 -1
|57777767665
build
|..+x.......


view L key walkB2 origin 7 -1
|577777676655
build
|........x+..


view L key walkD2 origin 7 -1
|577777676655
build
|........x+..
